            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_pBKarN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/icon-rain-water.png",
            "title": "<strong>Cuts down clogs</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<ul><li>Stiff bristles help block most leaves and debris from packing the gutter solid.</li><li>Water flows through and around the bristles into the gutter and downspouts, even in heavy rain.</li><li>Helps reduce overflow that can stain siding and contribute to fascia, soffit, and foundation issues.</li></ul>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_BTHpfb": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/icon-long-lasting.png",
            "title": "<strong>Durable, roof‑friendly</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<ul><li>Galvanized steel core with UV‑protected bristles, built to handle years of sun and weather.</li><li>Designed not to touch or interfere with shingles or metal roofing, helping avoid warranty worries.</li><li>Flexible design that still works even if gutters have minor dents or hanger variations.</li></ul>",
